Our legal name is Fresh Del Monte Produce Inc., and we use the commercial name Del Monte Fresh Produce. We are an exempted holding company, incorporated under the laws of the Cayman Islands on August 29, 1996. At December 26, 2025, the close of our most recent fiscal year, members of the Abu-Ghazaleh family directly owned approximately 30.0% of our outstanding Ordinary Shares.

